  "title": "NASA Astronauts Receive Congressional Space Medal of Honor, NASA Names Two Artemis II Astronauts to Emeritus Program",
  "summary": "NASA astronauts Victor Glover and Christina Koch, CSA astronaut Jeremy Hansen, and NASA astronaut Reid Wiseman received the Congressional Space Medal of Honor for their service during the Artemis II mission. NASA has named Victor Glover and Reid Wiseman to the emeritus program to continue supporting NASA’s space exploration efforts.",
